OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face one-hour delay
OL,4,Aafter crash closes M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters are facing delays of up to an
OL,7,Fhour after a crash between a van and a
OL,8,Florry closed a section of the M6 in
OL,9,Fboth directions.
OL,11,FThe motorway has been shut been
OL,12,Fjunction 23 in Newton-le-Willows,
OL,13,FMerseyside, and junction 24 in
OL,14,FAshton-in-Makerfield, Greater
OL,15,FManchester, National Highways said.
OL,17,FMerseyside Police said the crash at
OL,18,F22:00 BST on Sunday resulted in a
OL,19,Fvehicle fire with Merseyside Fire and
OL,20,FRescue also at the scene alongside its
OL,21,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
