OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face one-hour delay
OL,4,Aafter crash closes M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe southbound carriageway was opened
OL,7,Fat 07:30 but the northbound carriageway
OL,8,Fremains closed. Diversions have been
OL,9,Fput in place.
